Z||000027||Fierobruiser||12-06-2001||10:26 PM||||Mid engine equals exotic. Panteras are mid-engined, Ferraris are mid engined, Lambos are mid-engined Fieros are mid engined just not as expensive but they do meet the requirement of exotic cars and exotic women. They're all high maintenance. Just be glad we all have Rodney, the Fiero Store, Kick Hill Farm, Archie  and all those other great Fiero people and e-bay too. Ferrari owners might wish that they had the same options.<P>------------------<BR>Notchbacks Rule<BR>85GT(show car)<BR>88Coupe (daily driver)<BR>84 Coupe(project car)||||reg||1
